    skos:prefLabel "7 After subsection 19AL(6) (before the note)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-7 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (7) If the Attorney-General does not, in accordance with subsection (6), make, or refuse to make, a parole order for a person before:  (a) the end of the period referred to in paragraph (6)(a); or  (b) the date of the expected release referred to in paragraph (6)(b); the Attorney-General must, as soon as practicable after the end of that period or the date of that expected release, make, or refuse to make, a parole order for the person." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (7) If the Attorney-General does not, in accordance with subsection (6), make, or refuse to make, a parole order for a person before:  (a) the end of the period referred to in paragraph (6)(a); or  (b) the date of the expected release referred to in paragraph (6)(b); the Attorney-General must, as soon as practicable after the end of that period or the date of that expected release, make, or refuse to make, a parole order for the person."@en ;
