concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-sch-2-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Section 300.2 of the Criminal Code (definition of border"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "controlled plant) Repeal the definition, substitute: border controlled plant:  (a) means a growing plant that is a border controlled plant within the meaning of subsection 301.5(1); and  (b) to avoid doubt, includes a growing plant that is, under subsection 301.5(2) or 301.13(1A), taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled plant only in relation to particular offences against this Part or particular elements of those offences." ;
    skos:definition "controlled plant) Repeal the definition, substitute: border controlled plant:  (a) means a growing plant that is a border controlled plant within the meaning of subsection 301.5(1); and  (b) to avoid doubt, includes a growing plant that is, under subsection 301.5(2) or 301.13(1A), taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled plant only in relation to particular offences against this Part or particular elements of those offences."@en ;
