concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-sch-2-sec-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8 At the end of section 301.4 of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-8 ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (2) However:  (a) the regulations may provide that a listed border controlled drug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation to particular offences against this Part, or particular elements of those offences; and  (b) if the regulations so provide, then the listed border controlled drug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation to those offences or elements.  (3) To avoid doubt, if a listed border controlled drug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation to particular offences against this Part, or particular elements of those offences, then a drug analogue of the listed border controlled drug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation to those offences or elements.  Border controlled drugs, plants and precursors  Schedule 2  No. 98, 2023 Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 2) Act 2023" ;
    skos:definition "Add:  (2) However:  (a) the regulations may provide that a listed border controlled drug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation to particular offences against this Part, or particular elements of those offences; and  (b) if the regulations so provide, then the listed border controlled drug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation to those offences or elements.  (3) To avoid doubt, if a listed border controlled drug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation to particular offences against this Part, or particular elements of those offences, then a drug analogue of the listed border controlled drug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation to those offences or elements.  Border controlled drugs, plants and precursors  Schedule 2  No. 98, 2023 Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 2) Act 2023"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f552a1e79bdc74d313b3f0f000e309faa363c9b81f8db6b9d0fb2b41f0dcea48" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-sch-2-sec-8-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-sch-2-sec-8-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus.pdf, p.10" .
doc:sch-2-sec-8 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "8 At the end of section 301.4 of the Criminal Code" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (2) However:  (a) the regulations may provide that a listed border controlled drug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation to particular offences against this Part, or particular elements of those offences; and  (b) if the regulations so provide, then the listed border controlled drug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation to those offences or elements.  (3) To avoid doubt, if a listed border controlled drug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation to particular offences against this Part, or particular elements of those offences, then a drug analogue of the listed border controlled drug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation to those offences or elements.  Border controlled drugs, plants and precursors  Schedule 2  No. 98, 2023 Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 2) Act 2023" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-sch-2-sec-8-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8(2) At the end of section 301.4 of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-8-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) However:  (a) the regulations may provide that a listed border controlled drug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation to particular offences against this Part, or particular elements of those offences; and  (b) if the regulations so provide, then the listed border controlled drug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation to those offences or elements." ;
    skos:definition "(2) However:  (a) the regulations may provide that a listed border controlled drug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation to particular offences against this Part, or particular elements of those offences; and  (b) if the regulations so provide, then the listed border controlled drug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation to those offences or elements."@en ;
