concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-sch-2-sec-23 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23 Application provision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-23 ;
    values:originalText "The amendments of the Customs Act 1901 made by this Schedule apply in relation to determinations under Subdivision C of Division 301 of the Criminal Code made before, on or after the commencement of this Schedule.  Validations relating to the Australian Crime Commission Act 2002  Schedule 3  No. 98, 2023 Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 2) Act 2023" ;
    skos:definition "The amendments of the Customs Act 1901 made by this Schedule apply in relation to determinations under Subdivision C of Division 301 of the Criminal Code made before, on or after the commencement of this Schedule.  Validations relating to the Australian Crime Commission Act 2002  Schedule 3  No. 98, 2023 Crimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 2) Act 2023"@en ;
